Package: ostserver-complete
Architecture: any
Section: science
Conflicts: ostserver
Replaces: ostserver
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libqt6sql6-sqlite, gsc, nginx, avahi-daemon
Description: Observatoire Sans Tête - all-in-one
 Backend + web UI + nginx, ready to use after a single install.
 .
 Same binaries as the "ostserver" package (not a dependent of it - the
 two Conflict/Replace each other and can never be installed together),
 plus the front/ web client's static files and an nginx site wiring
 them together, so a single `apt install ./ostserver-complete.deb`
 gets a working system - nginx resolves from the standard distribution
 archives, but libindi1 and gsc still require the ppa:mutlaqja/ppa PPA
 (confirmed 2026-10, see install-latest-complete.sh which adds it).
 .
 Pick this package to get a working system immediately; pick plain
 "ostserver" to bring your own web server/TLS/layout instead.

